Auth  Authorization: Bearer sk-or-...  (API key starts with  sk-or- )[__LINK_ICON] 
API Style OpenAI-compatible — drop-in replacement[__LINK_ICON]! 
OpenAPI Spec openapi.yaml / openapi.json[__LINK_ICON] 
