🔑 Authentication
 
- Header:  Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_KEY>  
- Optional headers (recommended):
-  HTTP-Referer : your app URL
-  X-Title : your app name 
- Get a key: openrouter.ai/keys → Create Key 
 
 
 
📡 Core Endpoints
 
1️⃣ Chat Completions — Main Endpoint
 
http  
POST https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions
 
 
Body:
 
json  
{
  "model": "openai/gpt-4o",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Hello!"}
  ]
}
 
 
Python example:
 
python  
from openai import OpenAI
client = OpenAI(
    base_url="https://openrouter.ai/api/v1",
    api_key="sk-or-..."
)
resp = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="openai/gpt-4o",
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "Hi"}]
)
print(resp.choices[0].message.content)
```[[__LINK_ICON]](https://openrouter.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/53571306246811-What-is-the-OpenRouter-API-base-URL-and-how-do-I-point-an-existing-SDK-at-it?f_link_type=f_linkinlinenote&flow_extra=eyJpbmxpbmVfZGlzcGxheV9wb3NpdGlvbiI6MCwiZG9jX3Bvc2l0aW9uIjowLCJkb2NfaWQiOiI1MDg2YzkwZmU1ZTg3ZWIxLTc3Y2NmZTliMDczMWExYmUifQ%3D%3D&inline_doc_id=5086c90fe5e87eb1-77ccfe9b0731a1be)

